      "writtenOn": "2026-02-16T16:55:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh, you meant all users of dmabuf. Hmm, we intend to wrap only dmabufs allocated from dmabuf heaps and used by NPUs, so this should not pose a problem but for generic wrapping of dmabufs (and upstreaming) you are right, I would either have to add a field to store the wrap_ctx or to hash vma to wrap_ctx. I\u0027ll add a check for vm_file being unchanged and fail if it is for now. If vm_file gets changed by mmap() we can fall back to hashing and use a different wrap_vm_ops which uses the hash instead of vm_file.",
      "parentUuid": "c234d777_130e0ab2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 454,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 455,
        "endChar": 25
      },
      "revId": "1589b633d0d603a082d0717dd48759f6e8c0301d",
